{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1414137-things-happening-during-a-martial-arts-tournament","id":1414137,"title":"Things happening during a Martial Arts tournament","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-09-16T22:54:03-07:00","id":1414137,"title":"Things happening during a Martial Arts tournament","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, Fira Sans, Droid Sans, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#141414\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">What mischief can the PC's get up to before, between, during or after fights</span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12378-fma245","name":"FMA245","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-16T23:44:57-07:00","id":1414140,"title":"","content":"What scale are we talking for &quot;mischief&quot; and what are the restrictions in place on them? Like are they supposed to be in a dressing room or locker room between matches, are there days between rounds?<br /> <br /> I just would like to know since one of my first thoughts involved slipping laxatives or something into the drinks of competitors they don't like, and assassination.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-16T23:45:21-07:00","id":1414141,"title":"","content":"Poison<br /> Get poisoned<br /> Sleep with someone who will be an opponent<br /> Fight someone who needs to win more than you do<br /> Watch Shang Tsun eat a guy's soul<br /> Realize the tournament is cover for a cult<br /> Realize the tournament is cover for a theft<br /> Do a theft under cover of a tournament<br /> Befriend a noodle cart guy<br /> Realize that noodle cart guy is a master of a lost style<br /> Get jumped before a match<br /> Accidentally reveal that opponent is an aristocrat using an alias<br /> Mistake a grandmaster for a spectator<br /> Realize a friendly stray animal is actually a combatant<br /> Kill god<br /> Retire from martial arts to run a noodle stand<br /> Realize a piece of junk practice weapon is actually a long lost artifact<br /> Exalt from winning<br /> Exalt from losing<br /> Beat your enemy with a voluntary handicap<br /> Fight someone whose disability strengthens their martial art<br /> Go on extreme defense while defeating your opponent via philosophical rhetoric<br /> Use your fists to explain your philosophy<br /> Kill a different god<br /> Start a battle while inebriated<br /> Mistake a drunken fist master for a regular drunk<br /> Curbstomp somebody so bad their pupils take revenge<br /> Fall in love with said pupil before said curbstomping<br /> Fight a wild animal instead of a person<br /> Interrupt a century long sidereal plan by accident<br /> Win a fight by getting sick in a way that defeats your opponents strategy<br /> Kill a sidereal pretending to be a god pretending to be a noodle cart guy<br /> Have intercourse with a sidereal pretending to be the pupil of a sidereal pretending to be a god pretending to be a noodle cart guy<br /> Hear a defeated sidereal say &quot;just as planned&quot;<br /> Punch an elephant","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-17T00:26:00-07:00","id":1414146,"title":"","content":"Investigate an opponent you feel is being coerced into participating.<br /> Test out your prototype combat robot on a competitor.<br /> An alternate for a team has murdered one of the members so he can take his place.<br /> Guild factors are gambling on the results of the tournament.<br /> A mysterious sifu offers some last-minute training in a secret technique.<br /> Someone offers a generous sum if you can uncover the identity of the Masked Fighter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-17T01:33:53-07:00","id":1414154,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sorcerous Overlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1414137-things-happening-during-a-martial-arts-tournament?p=1414141#post1414141\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Poison<br /> Get poisoned<br /> Sleep with someone who will be an opponent<br /> Fight someone who needs to win more than you do<br /> Watch Shang Tsun eat a guy's soul<br /> Realize the tournament is cover for a cult<br /> Realize the tournament is cover for a theft<br /> Do a theft under cover of a tournament<br /> Befriend a noodle cart guy<br /> Realize that noodle cart guy is a master of a lost style<br /> Get jumped before a match<br /> Accidentally reveal that opponent is an aristocrat using an alias<br /> Mistake a grandmaster for a spectator<br /> Realize a friendly stray animal is actually a combatant<br /> Kill god<br /> Retire from martial arts to run a noodle stand<br /> Realize a piece of junk practice weapon is actually a long lost artifact<br /> Exalt from winning<br /> Exalt from losing<br /> Beat your enemy with a voluntary handicap<br /> Fight someone whose disability strengthens their martial art<br /> Go on extreme defense while defeating your opponent via philosophical rhetoric<br /> Use your fists to explain your philosophy<br /> Kill a different god<br /> Start a battle while inebriated<br /> Mistake a drunken fist master for a regular drunk<br /> Curbstomp somebody so bad their pupils take revenge<br /> Fall in love with said pupil before said curbstomping<br /> Fight a wild animal instead of a person<br /> Interrupt a century long sidereal plan by accident<br /> Win a fight by getting sick in a way that defeats your opponents strategy<br /> Kill a sidereal pretending to be a god pretending to be a noodle cart guy<br /> Have intercourse with a sidereal pretending to be the pupil of a sidereal pretending to be a god pretending to be a noodle cart guy<br /> Hear a defeated sidereal say &quot;just as planned&quot;<br /> Punch an elephant</div> </div> </div> </div>Nice one. I'd probably add something like : Twists the rules of a round to make more spectacle (eg : fighters must fight with a blindfold, etc ...) in a way that give an advantage to some guy because it's his specialty. Also, make some kind of &quot;challenge or tests&quot; to redeem the people that broke the tournament rules but because it was necessary (interrupting a fighter killing another on stage, moving the sacred mut-never-be-touched statue because the ceiling is crumbling on it or being stolen or whatever.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My homebrew (Leave comments if you want to help improve) : <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1hPx-Q2jlDgAIZX_d0wQWmJkZMN51jas4QNp5meeQjgo/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">A quick recap of all the pools and stats for Quick Exalted 3E characters</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24291-chausse","name":"Chausse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-17T02:25:14-07:00","id":1414159,"title":"","content":"Accidentally cause a civil war, a thousand year long family feud, and an anguished (or several) declarations of love when fighting in the arena, between punches and kicks","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-17T06:28:19-07:00","id":1414187,"title":"","content":"Be your opponent\u2019s therapist<br /> Be inexplicably clearly audible to the audience","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-17T06:37:50-07:00","id":1414189,"title":"","content":"Accidentally reveal yourself as a Solar.... <br /> <br /> Only to suddenly realize that everyone in the tournament is also some manner of 'Anathema'. This includes the monkey, who is a Lunar with Monkey Style, and the cleaning lady, who turns out to be an Infernalist Dragonblooded with knowledge of Black Claw.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-17T07:39:25-07:00","id":1414200,"title":"","content":"- Falsify your credentials for entering<br /> - Steal a belt from an official to complete your disguise<br /> - Have your beloved sneak into the tournament facilities by charming gullible officials<br /> - Have your sensei and said beloved offer you inspirational support from the sidelines, thus inspiring you to prove your superiority \u2013 that you're the best <i>around</i><br /> - Defeat many foes, proving the superiority of your dojo. Even that psycho who does that kickass head bobbing thing<br /> - Be badly wounded by an underhanded blow and make a miraculous recovery thanks to your sensei\u2019s mastery of obscure healing techniques<br /> - Withstand the brutal yet creative taunts of your assembled foes with your newly mastered integrity skills. You will not go in a body bag...<br /> - Endure vicious wound penalties and attacks aimed to exploit them, delivered at the behest of the vicious master of an opposing school<br /> - Illegally take down your greatest rival with an unblockable secret technique","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24647,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24647-moss-reynholm","user":"Moss Reynholm","date":". 09-17-2020, 04:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24647-moss-reynholm","name":"Moss Reynholm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24647_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-17T13:19:31-07:00","id":1414255,"title":"","content":"Accidently kill the master of the Dojo the tournament is being held at during the exhibition bout to introduce it (this is a thing that actually happened in one of our 2nd ed. DB games due to an inopportune use of Five Dragon Force Blow)<br /> <br /> Challenge all the other participants to a fight at the same time and win.<br /> <br /> Challenge all the other participants to a fight at the same time and lose.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26249,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26249-keelbreaker","user":"Keelbreaker","date":". 09-17-2020, 04:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26249-keelbreaker","name":"Keelbreaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26249_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-17T14:21:18-07:00","id":1414265,"title":"","content":"Fend off an assassination/sabotage so cleanly and easily that it makes officials assume the circle are accomplices due to not having been attacked.<br /> <br /> Steal wallets of all other competitors.<br /> Steal socks and underwear for all other competitors.<br /> Show up to a match wearing an outfit made entirely of the stolen socks of your opponents<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-18T09:47:05-07:00","id":1414415,"title":"","content":"My favorite part of <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar8830_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"8830\" data-vbnamecard=\"8830\">Sorcerous Overlord</a>'s list is that Kill God is in the upper-middle of the list. Neither the first or last thing thought of, just somewhere middling. So very Exalted.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-18T10:50:51-07:00","id":1414424,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Unsung Hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1414137-things-happening-during-a-martial-arts-tournament?p=1414415#post1414415\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My favorite part of <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar8830_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"8830\" data-vbnamecard=\"8830\">Sorcerous Overlord</a>'s list is that Kill God is in the upper-middle of the list. Neither the first or last thing thought of, just somewhere middling. So very Exalted.</div> </div> </div> </div>I read &quot;kill a god&quot; and just rolled my eyes.<br /> <br /> But when I read &quot;kill a different god&quot;, I thought... &quot;hey, this has potential&quot;...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-18T11:34:48-07:00","id":1414431,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Unsung Hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1414137-things-happening-during-a-martial-arts-tournament?p=1414415#post1414415\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My favorite part of <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar8830_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"8830\" data-vbnamecard=\"8830\">Sorcerous Overlord</a>'s list is that Kill God is in the upper-middle of the list. Neither the first or last thing thought of, just somewhere middling. So very Exalted.</div> </div> </div> </div>Agreed!<br /> <br /> I on the other hand seem to have outed my childhood Karate Kid obsession to <i>zero</i> effect...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24647-moss-reynholm","name":"Moss Reynholm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24647_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-18T16:54:53-07:00","id":1414486,"title":"","content":"- get into an argument that results in an npc betting the outcome of some other important plot on the result of your match.<br /> - get tangled into a side quest that requires that some other, rather weak guy wins his next match, so you have to quickly come up with a plan to help him.<br /> - get an unexpected chance to beat the crap out of some npc you couldn't touch during previous adventures. Of course he will fight dirty.<br /> - get tangled into a side quest that threatens you with a default if you get late to your match.<br /> - get targeted by enemies who try to either frame or trick you into breaking the rules. <br /> - fight a guy who's bribed the ref into overlooking his foul play. <br /> - have a person dear to you taken hostage in an effort to make you throw a fight - stall a match while your friends try to rescue her. <br /> - face a naive new guy who is just trying to help his friends or something, beating the crap out of him until he suddenly starts monologuing and exalts on the spot. <br /> - see a massive attack on the stadium half way through the final match, as someone decides to hit a number of high value targets with assassins/monsters.<br /> -- bonus points if the whole tournament turns out to be an elaborate trap for your circle. <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23788-braininthejar","name":"Braininthejar","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"170"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-18T23:04:58-07:00","id":1414510,"title":"","content":"Dozens of different players, including you, have made plans and schemes for this match. <br /> <br /> Those schemes turn out to be for nothing when some noob from the rural areas manage to beat up the god-blooded martial arts champion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-24T18:02:24-07:00","id":1415347,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sith_Happens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1414137-things-happening-during-a-martial-arts-tournament?p=1414187#post1414187\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Be your opponent\u2019s therapist</div> </div> </div> </div>My dawn did that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1777-kell_tamer","name":"Kell_Tamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1777_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-24T18:32:07-07:00","id":1415349,"title":"","content":"Have various powerful spectators offer you lodgings and feasts when you win.<br /> Have same fickle benefactors kick you out when you lose.<br /> Talk to the bookies about who's bet how much on your success, and your failure.<br /> Check the betting odds to see who is favored to win.<